<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-040" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-040-zihan" source-id="s-nanqishu-040-zihan-ws2272748">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-040-zihan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">南海王<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zihan:p001:m0003" ref="kix_r92_2ed_C">子罕</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zihan:p001:m0006" ref="kix_r92_2ed_C">雲華</persName>，世祖第十一子也。永明六年，爲北中郎將、南琅邪彭城二郡太守。上初以白下地帶江山，徙琅邪郡自金城治之，<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zihan:p001:m0058" ref="kix_r92_2ed_C">子罕</persName>始鎮此城。十年，爲持節、都督南兖兖徐青冀五州軍事、征虜將軍、南兖州刺史。鬱林卽位，進號後將軍。隆昌元年，遷散騎常侍、右衞將軍。建武元年，轉護軍將軍。二年，見殺。年十七。</p>
</text>
